<title>FRANCE: French net 97 privatisation receipts 25.65 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>French net 97 privatisation receipts 25.65 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net French privatisation receipts are estimated at 25.65 billion francs in 1997 and 2.445 billion francs of that is to go in a capital injection to Charbonnages de France, a recently published National Assembly report said.</p>
<p>&quot;The money earmarked for Charbonnages de France has been precisely evaluated, 2,445 million francs,&quot; says the report from the lower house of parliament's finance commission.</p>
<p>&quot;The main beneficiaries of funding should be the defeasance structures of Credit Lyonnais and Comptoir des Entrepreneurs, GIAT-Industries and the new state company in charge of financing the national rail network,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
